      '<b>Leader se akele me seedhi baat</b>: "Adi, Farhan ko bahar rakhna mujhe theek nahi lag raha. Agar usse koi issue hai to seedha baat karo, group ko beech me mat lao."',
      '<b>Ek saathi dhoondho</b>: Asch ke conformity experiments me ek bhi saathi milne par log kahin zyada aasaani se apni baat keh paate the. Pehle Neha ya Joel se baat karo, phir saath me bolo.',
      '<b>Agar tum Farhan ki jagah ho</b>: kisi ek bharosemand dost se seedha poochho, "Kya mujhe jaanbujh kar plans se bahar rakha ja raha hai?" Jawab jo bhi ho, apni value un logon se mat naapo jo chup rahe. Doosre rishton me bhi time do.',
      '<b>Neend, mood ya khud ko bekaar lagna</b> hafton tak chale to kisi bharosemand insaan ya <b>Tele-MANAS 14416</b> se baat karo.'
